    "Meshes heard advertising themselves via beacons, outside a scan. These also pre-select in the next scan setup." : {
      "comment" : "A footer for the list of nearby beacons.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
